    <section id="why-me" class="dark-section border-b py-24" style="border-color:#262626"><div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8"><div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12"><div class="lg:col-span-5"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight sm:text-5xl">Why most video edits fail on social.</h2><p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-neutral-400">Good editing is more than making footage look polished. The edit has to make the message clear quickly and give the viewer a reason to stay.</p></div><div class="space-y-5 lg:col-span-7"><div class="rounded-xl border bg-[#0c0c0d] p-6" style="border-color:#262626"><div class="mb-2 font-mono text-sm font-semibold" style="color:var(--lime)">Retention-First Editing</div><p class="text-base leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">I focus on the first few seconds, pacing, clarity, visual reinforcement, and the moments that keep attention moving through the video.</p></div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div class="rounded-xl border bg-[#0c0c0d] p-5" style="border-color:#262626"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-neutral-400">Pacing</span><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Removing dead space while keeping the speaker natural and the story easy to follow.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border bg-[#0c0c0d] p-5" style="border-color:#262626"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-neutral-400">Visual Hooks</span><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Using captions, b-roll, movement, and graphics when they actually strengthen the message.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border bg-[#0c0c0d] p-5" style="border-color:#262626"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-neutral-400">Sound & Rhythm</span><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Sound choices that support the pace and make important moments feel intentional.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border bg-[#0c0c0d] p-5" style="border-color:#262626"><span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase text-neutral-400">Platform Ready</span><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-neutral-300">Vertical edits built for the way people actually consume Shorts, Reels, and TikTok.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
