iv class="grid gap-4 py-8 md:grid-cols-12"><div class="md:col-span-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">AI Creative</h3><span class="mono text-xs" style="color:var(--muted)">AI-generated product content</span></div><div class="text-sm leading-relaxed md:col-span-6" style="color:var(--muted)">Developing realistic AI-generated product ads and UGC concepts designed for social platforms.</div><div class="text-right md:col-span-2"><span class="mono rounded bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs">AI</span></div></div></div></section>
    <section id="process" class="mx-auto max-w-6xl border-b px-5 py-20 sm:px-8" style="border-color:var(--border)"><div class="reveal mb-14"><h2 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight sm:text-5xl">How We Work Together</h2></div><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="rounded-xl border p-6" style="background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--border)"><span class="mono text-2xl font-bold">01</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-bold uppercase">Understand</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--muted)">We align on the audience, platform, message, creative direction, and raw footage.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border p-6" style="background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--border)"><span class="mono text-2xl font-bold">02</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-bold uppercase">Build & Cut</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--muted)">I build the hook, pacing, captions, visuals, sound design, and overall structure.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border p-6" style="background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--border)"><span class="mono text-2xl font-bold">03</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-bold uppercase">Refine</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--muted)">We review the draft and tighten the details until the edit feels right.</p></div><div class="rounded-xl border p-6" style="background:var(--surface);border-color:var(--border)"><span class="mono text-2xl font-bold">04</span><h3 class="mt-4 font-bold uppercase">Deliver</h3><p class="mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed" style="color:var(--muted)">You receive a final social-ready video formatted for the platform.</p></div></div></section>
